    "Apply a lag correction: if true outcome is significantly higher than forecast, reduce forecast by 5-10% for the next 3-5 days to account for momentum.",
    "Cap upward spikes in forecast above 70.00 to prevent overshoot after sharp price increases.",
    "Use mean reversion: if forecast deviates >10% from 30-day moving average, revert toward the average within 2-3 days.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to recent true outcomes when sentiment is positive (sentiment > 0.25) to capture momentum.",
    "Reduce forecast volatility when sentiment is neutral, to avoid overfitting to short-term noise."
